      "title": "V5DL: Get rid of tvb_new_subset_length_caplen",
      "message": "V5DL: Get rid of tvb_new_subset_length_caplen\n\nThis is in ifdef'ed out code, but there are three cases where\ntvb_new_subset_length_caplen is used to explicitly give the\ncaptured length, but in all three cases it would be automatically\ntrimmed to the minimum of the actual captured length and the\nreported length so the code can be simplified. The only check\nthat is needed is about whether to dissect the FCS.\n",
